    "detailed_description": "Explore the unknown lands of Talus. Play the way you want with hundreds of builds to choose from! Complete randomized dungeons, obtain epic loot, craft perfect gear and hunt down uber bosses. Talus is a Diablo II/Path of Exile inspired Action RPG set in a vibrant fantasy 2D world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>- <strong>Build Diversity.</strong> Try any of the five classes: Mage, Ranger, Warrior, Necromancer, Druid, with hundreds of abilities and talents to choose from.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/b8e20af3973e87f8e51af4d285c8660c.poster.avif?t=1740291350\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/b8e20af3973e87f8e51af4d285c8660c.webm?t=1740291350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/b8e20af3973e87f8e51af4d285c8660c.mp4?t=1740291350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>- <strong>Build Enhancing Unique Items</strong>. Tailor your build to your playstyle with any of the 200+ unique items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/897bdb77cf8aca00b7a48339002dad2c.avif?t=1740291350\" width=380 height=468 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/d1029d7890ef48d16b4cd354252ee87c.avif?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br><br>- <strong>Endless Replayability.</strong> Complete randomized and infinitely scaling end-game zones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/blueprint.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br>  <br>- <strong>Focus on Crafting.</strong> Craft the perfect item for your build with gemstones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone1.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone2.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone3.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br>\t<br>- <strong>Challenging End-Game Content.</strong> Push your build to the absolute limit against the end-game uber bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for being fun.</h2> There is no room for unnecessary grind/annoying mechanics/time-gated content just to keep you playing for longer. Play whenever you want, however you want and for as long or as little as you want!<br><br>Wishlist now &amp; join us in Talus!",
