484 height=560 /></span><br>  <br>- <strong>Focus on Crafting.</strong> Craft the perfect item for your build with gemstones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone1.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone2.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948410/extras/gemstone3.PNG?t=1740291350\" width=484 height=560 /></span><br>\t<br>- <strong>Challenging End-Game Content.</strong> Push your build to the absolute limit against the end-game uber bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for being fun.</h2> There is no room for unnecessary grind/annoying mechanics/time-gated content just to keep you playing for longer. Play whenever you want, however you want and for as long or as little as you want!<br><br>Wishlist now &amp; join us in Talus!",
